-- A fill owes counselling until a Counselling exists for it, written as a filter over the
-- shape. The spec does not declare Counselling.
--
-- The compiler reads the undeclared name as a field of Fill, and then reads the filter's
-- `fill` on Fill too, so the one missing name draws two messages.
act Fill { fillNumber: integer }

shape CounsellingDue = Fill where not exists (Counselling where fill == this)
